  "title": "Chocolate-Peppermint Cheesecake",
  "description": "This chocolate peppermint cheesecake is a delicious blend of chocolate cookies and a minty chocolate filling; top with crushed peppermint candy for a truly festive dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "PHILADELPHIA Cream Cheese"
  ],
